# Source media kept in the repo but not served by the site.
#
# Looping_carosuel.mov is the original export; the site plays the converted
# public/hero-loop.mp4. stockwelding1.mp4 is unused footage. blueStarMockup.png
# is the design reference — it's named in code comments but never loaded, and
# it has no business being fetchable on a URL handed to a client.
#
# Together they're ~41MB of a 43MB public/ directory. Excluding them here
# leaves the files on disk and just keeps them out of the deployment.
public/Looping_carosuel.mov
public/stockwelding1.mp4
public/blueStarMockup.png
